    "Caution is the clearest point of agreement, and it serves this person well when decisions carry real consequences. The friction appears around conflict. Capricorn can be blunt when standards slip, while the Rabbit would rather smooth things over than confront, so a Capricorn Rabbit may swallow frustration until it hardens into coldness. Seen this way, they have both a spine and a soft touch, which is rare in management or family life. They may also avoid necessary risks because both halves value safety. Naming small disagreements early, in a neutral tone, keeps them from growing. Consider setting one stretching goal each year that feels slightly uncomfortable, so that prudence stays a tool rather than becoming the whole personality.",
