    "Both halves are dependable and hard-working, and that reinforcement gives this person a solid reputation. The pull comes from attitude to pleasure. Capricorn tends to postpone enjoyment until the work is done, while the Pig believes enjoyment is part of the point, so a Capricorn Pig may alternate between strict austerity and generous indulgence. Handled well, this lets them model a balanced life to others. The Pig's trust can also clash with Capricorn's wariness, producing occasional disappointment. Building modest pleasures into routines, rather than saving them as rewards, eases the swing. Consider setting clear boundaries around lending money or time, since this combination's generosity is genuine and others sometimes rely on it more than is fair.",
