    "Idealism and loyalty reinforce each other, so this person tends to be a steadfast friend and a dependable member of any group. The divergence lies in temperament. Aquarius analyses from a cool distance, while the Dog worries and feels injustice personally, so an Aquarius Dog may move between detached reasoning and genuine anxiety. Together that gives them both perspective and heart. Pessimism and stubbornness are shared risks, especially when a cause stalls. Celebrating small victories, rather than measuring only against the ideal, keeps morale up. Consider limiting the number of causes taken on at once, which protects energy and allows the Dog's loyalty and Uranus's originality to deepen in one place.",
