    "Tolerance and generosity reinforce each other, so this person tends to be welcoming and quietly influential. The tension lies between detachment and indulgence. Aquarius can live in ideas, while the Pig enjoys physical comfort and pleasure, so an Aquarius Pig may alternate between austere idealism and relaxed enjoyment. This lets them make causes feel convivial rather than grim. Being taken advantage of is a shared risk, as both halves can be trusting. Clear limits on favours and loans, explained kindly but firmly, protect the goodwill. Consider joining or building a community project that combines social good with shared meals or celebration, where both halves feel thoroughly at home. Generosity lasts longer when it is chosen rather than extracted.",
